.TH "PACE ACTIVITY" "1" "2026-05-17" "0.1.0" "pace activity Manual"
.SH NAME
pace\-activity \- Workouts and activity history.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B pace activity
[OPTIONS] COMMAND [ARGS]...
.SH DESCRIPTION
Workouts and activity history.
.SH COMMANDS
.PP
\fBlist\fP
  List recent activities.
  See \fBpace activity-list(1)\fP for full documentation on the \fBlist\fP command.
.PP
\fBshow\fP
  Show one activity by ID.
  See \fBpace activity-show(1)\fP for full documentation on the \fBshow\fP command.
.PP
\fBsplits\fP
  Show splits/laps for an activity.
  See \fBpace activity-splits(1)\fP for full documentation on the \fBsplits\fP command.
.PP
\fBweather\fP
  Weather conditions during an activity.
  See \fBpace activity-weather(1)\fP for full documentation on the \fBweather\fP command.
.PP
\fBlast\fP
  Show the most recent activity.
  See \fBpace activity-last(1)\fP for full documentation on the \fBlast\fP command.
.PP
\fBexport\fP
  Download an activity in...
  See \fBpace activity-export(1)\fP for full documentation on the \fBexport\fP command.
.PP
\fBexport-range\fP
  Download every activity in a date range to...
  See \fBpace activity-export-range(1)\fP for full documentation on the \fBexport-range\fP command.
